  "hindi": "जो कहता है, 'इन्द्र के लिए, उस नर के लिए, पौरुषवान् के लिए, नरों में सर्वाधिक पौरुषवान् के लिए हम सोम निचोड़ें,' उसके लिए भारत अग्नि आश्रय प्रदान करे; वह देर तक उदय होते हुए सूर्य को देखे।",
  "english": "For him who says, 'Let us press for Indra, the man, the manly one, the most manly of men,' may Agni the Bhārata extend shelter; may he see the sun rising for long.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "The subject of paśyāt is not stated; it is read as the man addressed in tasmai (the one who presses), but Agni is also grammatically possible. nare naryāya nṛtamāya nṝṇām are taken as datives agreeing with indrāya. bhārataḥ is rendered as an epithet of Agni.",
